WEBVTT

00:39:32.179 --> 00:39:35.491
I was sad, because a lot of my friends

00:39:35.515 --> 00:39:39.828
and people I really care deeply about
and have a ton of respect for

00:39:39.852 --> 00:39:42.673
were very directly affected by it.

00:39:45.796 --> 00:39:50.705
I was sad, because a lot
of what the company stood for

00:39:50.729 --> 00:39:53.485
and the way that it treated
its customers and members

00:39:53.509 --> 00:39:54.991
were still very much true.

00:39:55.015 --> 00:39:57.477
None of the media was about that.

00:39:57.501 --> 00:39:59.203
Like the product was good.

00:39:59.681 --> 00:40:04.919
The achievements
that we were able to accomplish